                  "content": "component/AlertDialog → 2V72x\n\nCentered modal — title + body + cancel/action buttons. Background uses $bg-primary.\n\nDescendant override paths (ref+'/<id>'):\n- zso1V: alertTitle (제목)\n- 4JHb0: alertBody (description)\n- 7qyWM: cancelLbl (cancel button label)\n- XVDwN: actionLbl (action button label, $accent-red fill)\n\nApplied to: 12. Reset Flashcard Dialog (uriMD), 13. Unsaved Changes Dialog (C7cSU). Use layoutPosition:absolute + x/y on instances since dialog is overlay-positioned."
                }
              ]
